1947	/**
1948	 * Moves an insight from one scope/project to a different project.
1949	 *
1950	 * Supports two move variants:
1951	 * - global → project: promotes the global insight into a named project store
1952	 * - project → project: moves a project insight to a different project
1953	 *
1954	 * Uses add-first-then-delete ordering for the same safety rationale as
1955	 * `handlePromoteKnowledge`.
